          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 He pu-chaihthiu, huayneyna bam tho!",
            "Kaganv rau the! Ravguangc kaw bam the!",
            "Kaganv luaimei kaeng hiw bam the,",
            "Kaganv tyn khou lungc bam di the.",
            "",
            "Tingsaeng ganv kiu ’naa guang pw the!",
            "Tingsang ganv kiu ’naa guang pw the!",
            "",
            "2 He pu-chaih thiu, Pou ta thuanc bam tho,",
            "Tingpuk laanc the, rih hei luai guang the;",
            "Hymdaihmei kiu ’naa guang pw the,",
            "Guangh guay Guangc kiu guang puni the!",
            "",
            "3 He pu-chaih thiu, changkhaanvna bam tho!",
            "Kaganv, tingkwm, kating luai guang the,",
            "’Khwan tho, theic kan nimei pu ta",
            "Kabuc sin tut khang ’khwanmei kumc.",
            "",
            "4 He pu-chaih thiu, zauc lo, gaanc pat the!",
            "Theihmei t’rou khou ^&8 ringcthau pw the,",
            "Sianlang langna chamdaanv bam tho;",
            "Zauc lo, Nowpouc 8^& guang pw the!"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
